## 4. Architecture

### 4.1 System Context

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    User Request                              │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│            Coordinator Agent (meta_agent)                    │
│  - Main session: abc123 (user's conversation)                │
│  - Tools: create_sub_agent, continue_sub_agent,              │
│           list_sub_agents, delete_sub_agent                  │
│  - System prompt shows: "Active sub-agents: research_001"    │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ├─► Tool Call: create_sub_agent
                       │   {agent: "web_research_agent", 
                       │    task: "Research AI regulations",
                       │    instance_id: null}  # Auto-generate
                       │
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│          Sub-Agent Manager (New Component)                   │
│  - Generates instance_id: "abc123:web_research_agent:001"   │
│  - Creates sub-session file: abc123_sub_research_001.json   │
│  - Links to parent session: abc123                           │
│  - Tracks: created_at, last_used, agent_type, status        │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│       Sub-Agent Instance (web_research_agent)                │
│  - Session ID: abc123_sub_research_001                       │
│  - Message history: [user, assistant, tool_result, ...]     │
│  - Tool state: {sequential_thinking: session_xyz}            │
│  - Request ID: req_abc123_001                                │
└──────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┘
                       │
                       ▼ (Returns result to coordinator)
```

