```

### 4.3 Integration Points

| Component | Integration | Changes Needed |
|-----------|-------------|----------------|
| **Agent** | Calls `SubAgentManager` via new tools | Add 4 new MCP tools |
| **SessionTracker** | Extended to manage sub-sessions | Add sub-session methods |
| **SessionManager** | Store sub-sessions in same user directory | Schema extension |
| **System Prompt** | Inject active sub-agents before LLM call | Hook modification |
| **Request ID** | Generate hierarchical IDs for sub-agents | ID generation logic |

